  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "ATM-QA-AI37-001" ;
  triage:title "AI.37 required test for zero-work-vs-summary-emitted event-name distinction is missing" ;
  triage:description "Sprint sub-task 3's Required tests explicitly demand a test asserting emitted event names distinguish the zero-work outcome from the summary-emitted outcome. No such test exists in crates/atm-graft-python/tests/test_hermes_bridge.py on feature/pAI-s37-hermes-recovery-summary @ 5e122cf7. Required correction: add a test (e.g. via assertLogs) asserting a distinctly-named zero-work event, and wire the implementation to emit it. This is an acceptance-criteria gap identified by req-qa in QA-1." ;
