  triage:note "Required test for zero-work vs summary-emitted event-name distinction is absent from test_hermes_bridge.py. Remediation: add a test asserting a distinctly-named zero-work event (e.g. graft_recovery_no_work) and wire the implementation to emit it; see companion finding ATM-QA-AI37-002 for the implementation-side gap." ;
